\u003cdiv class=\"p-s12__feature-image p-spacing-bottom-a\"\u003e\u003csource\u003e\u003c/source\u003e\u003csource\u003e\u003c/source\u003e\u003csource\u003e\u003c/source\u003e\u003csource\u003e\u003c/source\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.philips.com/is/image/philipsconsumer/vrs_82e854adadff5616b3efdae57198061ab1271d8c?wid=305\u0026amp;hei=173\u0026amp;$jpglarge$\" alt=\"Làm sạch dễ dàng và nhanh chóng\" /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-s12__feature-description p-spacing-bottom-a\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"p-heading-04-large p-heading-bold p-feature-title\"\u003eLàm sạch dễ dàng và nhanh chóng\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p-body-copy-02\"\u003ePhụ kiện StarPlate chống dính của chúng tôi có thể dùng với máy rửa chén, giúp tiết kiệm thời gian làm sạch.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-s12__row\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-s12__feature-item p-spacing-bottom-c\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-s12__feature-image p-spacing-bottom-a\"\u003e\u003csource\u003e\u003c/source\u003e\u003csource\u003e\u003c/source\u003e\u003csource\u003e\u003c/source\u003e\u003csource\u003e\u003c/source\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.philips.com/is/image/philipsconsumer/vrs_6080f552aadabc54c4a3601e70c73ec4c1782865?wid=305\u0026amp;hei=173\u0026amp;$jpglarge$\" alt=\"Kích cỡ nồi chiên lý tưởng 6,2 lít cho mọi căn bếp\" /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-s12__feature-description p-spacing-bottom-a\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"p-heading-04-large p-heading-bold p-feature-title\"\u003eKích cỡ nồi chiên lý tưởng 6,2 lít cho mọi căn bếp\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p-body-copy-02\"\u003eThiết kế nhỏ gọn lý tưởng cho mọi căn bếp dù lớn hay nhỏ. Nồi chiên 6,2 lít chứa được tới 800 g khoai tây chiên, 8 đùi gà hoặc 800 g rau củ.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-s12__feature-item p-spacing-bottom-c\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-s12__feature-image p-spacing-bottom-a\"\u003e\u003csource\u0